---
import { withBase } from '../config/site.mjs';
---
<section class="receipt-section wrap" aria-labelledby="receipt-title">
  <div class="section-heading receipt-heading"><p class="eyebrow">A shipping example</p><h2 id="receipt-title">One request<br /><span>through the yard.</span></h2><p>The operator asks to fix a retry path. Native tools handle the implementation, followed by an independent local review. CE publishes the PR and owns feedback and CI. Delivery confirms the merge and verifies the result. <a class="text-link" href={withBase('/delivery/lifecycle/')}>See the delivery lifecycle.</a></p></div>
  <div class="terminal" aria-label="Illustrative chat transcript for an agent delivery">
    <div class="terminal-bar"><span></span><span></span><span></span><b>railyard / delivery result</b></div>
    <div class="terminal-body">
      <p class="speaker">you</p>
      <p><mark>“Fix the retry path.”</mark></p>
      <p><b class="check">✓</b> implementation and focused checks</p>
      <p><b class="check">✓</b> independent local review</p>
      <p><b class="check">✓</b> PR opened</p>
      <p><b class="check">✓</b> <a href={withBase('/delivery/gates/#one-review-and-ci-owner')}>CE review and CI settled</a></p>
      <p><b class="check">✓</b> merge reachable from <code>main</code></p>
      <p class="receipt-result"><span>post-merge proof</span><strong>verified</strong></p>
      <p class="terminal-note">Illustrative transcript. Actual usage is a chat request to your agent, not a shell command.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
